"between 1 and 4 segments."
msgstr ""
"Na koliko segmentov lahko video kodek VP8 razdeli sliko. VP8 sprejema med 1 "
"in 4 segmenti."

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_webp.rst:83
